sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant TL as timelinePlayer
  participant G as TimelineCommitGate
  participant S as Scheduler delay(0)
  participant D as dispatch TIMELINE_*
  participant R as matchReducer

  TL->>G: onStart(cues, placement)
  G->>G: flush pending (none)
  G->>D: TIMELINE_START
  D->>R: apply

  TL->>G: onCommit(patch A)
  G->>G: buffer = merge(buffer, A)
  G->>S: schedule flush if idle
  TL->>G: onCommit(patch B)
  G->>G: buffer = merge(buffer, B)
  Note over G: last-write-wins fields

  S->>G: delay(0) fires
  G->>D: TIMELINE_COMMIT(merged)
  D->>R: structural share

  TL->>G: onDone()
  G->>G: flush pending sync
  G->>D: TIMELINE_DONE
  D->>R: apply
